WEBVTT

00:05.967 --> 00:07.137
[SITARA] Simply put,

00:07.767 --> 00:09.687
you and Emperor Ögedei
have filled me

00:09.767 --> 00:11.017
with a sense of hope.

00:11.097 --> 00:12.107
[Boraqchin gasps]

00:12.397 --> 00:13.767
[SITARA] The great wisdom
you both display

00:13.857 --> 00:15.437
makes you worthy
of ruling this world

00:15.527 --> 00:17.437
with honor and grace. Yes.

00:17.527 --> 00:19.777
[tearfully]
Do you really think so?

00:20.487 --> 00:22.067
Of course I do.

00:22.617 --> 00:25.827
[BORAQCHIN] There's no need
for you to feel so nervous.

00:26.867 --> 00:29.957
I just have something
I wanted to discuss with you.

00:34.377 --> 00:35.457
♪

00:36.207 --> 00:38.337
-[indistinct chatter]
-[grunting]

00:40.167 --> 00:41.637
♪

00:43.757 --> 00:45.927
[ILÜGE] Good tidings,
Great Kha'an.

00:46.007 --> 00:47.977
Tolui has crossed the Han River.

00:48.057 --> 00:50.887
And the enemy troops
have begun scurrying southward.

00:52.097 --> 00:54.557
Tolui, you've done well.

00:55.647 --> 01:00.447
All right, let's make our move,
and cross the river ahead.

01:01.147 --> 01:03.697
[♪ opening theme song playing]

02:31.037 --> 02:33.747
So, my brother has crossed
the Yellow River?

02:33.827 --> 02:37.077
Yes. Reinforcements from
the Great Kha'an are coming.

02:37.167 --> 02:38.287
We should muster.

02:38.827 --> 02:40.497
That does seem wise.

02:40.587 --> 02:42.587
Well, do you know
of a good location?

02:42.667 --> 02:44.917
[SUBUTAI] Mount Sanfeng
will serve us well.

02:45.007 --> 02:46.177
♪

02:52.807 --> 02:57.397
[SITARA (ADULT)] 130 kilometers
from Kaifeng, the Jin capital.

02:57.767 --> 03:00.767
Tolui's army began positioning
themselves

03:00.857 --> 03:02.437
at the foot of Mount Sanfeng,

03:03.527 --> 03:06.237
awaiting the arrival
of reinforcements.

03:08.567 --> 03:11.577
Though, the opposing Jin army
seemed ready

03:11.657 --> 03:14.077
to confront them and wage war.

03:14.157 --> 03:15.117
[Wanyan exhales]

03:15.747 --> 03:17.957
[WANYAN] You bring orders
to launch an attack now?

03:18.037 --> 03:20.457
My men are thoroughly exhausted.

03:20.537 --> 03:22.417
I'm sure our enemy is as well.

03:22.797 --> 03:24.167
The bulk of their main force

03:24.257 --> 03:25.547
has its sights set
on the capital.

03:25.627 --> 03:27.717
[Wanyan gasps, grunts]

03:28.927 --> 03:31.467
Do away with their troops
at once.

03:31.547 --> 03:32.847
[cart rattling]

03:33.597 --> 03:35.227
What shall we do?

03:35.307 --> 03:36.807
Follow his orders.

03:36.887 --> 03:39.187
Fortunately,
we outnumber the enemy.

03:39.267 --> 03:41.397
So, we'll encircle them all.

03:44.477 --> 03:45.647
[Tolui sighs]

03:45.737 --> 03:47.737
They have us
completely surrounded.

03:47.817 --> 03:51.157
There are 150,000 troops,
at least.

03:51.237 --> 03:53.577
Oh, really? And our count?

03:54.077 --> 03:55.867
Under 40,000.

03:55.947 --> 03:57.457
-[laughs]
-Uh?

03:57.537 --> 03:59.077
It is no laughing matter, sir.

03:59.167 --> 04:00.537
If the Great Kha'an's
reinforcements

04:00.627 --> 04:02.287
don't make it in time,
we're done for.

04:02.377 --> 04:04.377
They will, so there's no need
for concern.

04:04.457 --> 04:06.547
-[all groaning]
-[neighs]

04:06.627 --> 04:08.007
[commander sighs]

04:08.667 --> 04:10.837
Fine. Then...

04:10.927 --> 04:14.137
how about we entrust
our fate to Tengri?

04:15.597 --> 04:16.767
What?

04:17.057 --> 04:19.727
Hmm. Bring me a soldier
who can perform

04:19.807 --> 04:21.147
the jadamishi rite.

04:31.487 --> 04:32.867
[COMMANDER]
The jadamishi is known

04:32.947 --> 04:34.827
to summon storms, isn't it?

04:34.907 --> 04:37.997
What is it he hopes to
accomplish by doing this rite?

04:38.077 --> 04:39.077
[Subutai sighs]

04:39.157 --> 04:41.747
♪

05:01.937 --> 05:04.647
[squawking]

05:24.247 --> 05:25.917
[all gasp softly]

05:27.707 --> 05:29.917
-Now it's...
-Snowing.

05:30.007 --> 05:31.217
And the wind's picked up.

05:31.297 --> 05:32.297
♪

05:35.177 --> 05:36.557
Tengri...

05:36.967 --> 05:39.677
So you have agreed
to grant our wish.

05:40.387 --> 05:41.517
[footsteps]

05:41.597 --> 05:43.347
[TOLUI] Listen up, men!

05:44.347 --> 05:47.067
Start digging trenches at once!

05:48.017 --> 05:50.357
Have all the men
and horses take cover

05:50.437 --> 05:52.317
before the storm arrives!

05:53.647 --> 05:55.367
Cover those horses in blankets.

05:55.447 --> 05:58.077
Our soldiers need to be
bundled up!

05:58.157 --> 06:00.157
[wind howling]

06:01.037 --> 06:04.247
[SITARA (ADULT)] The storm raged
for three days and nights.

06:04.327 --> 06:05.457
[grunting]

06:05.537 --> 06:07.127
[SITARA (ADULT)]
Swaying the fates

06:07.207 --> 06:10.417
of the two forces
through perilous weather.

06:13.087 --> 06:15.837
And then on the fourth day,

06:15.927 --> 06:19.007
the 150,000 strong Jin army...

06:19.097 --> 06:20.217
[Tolui laughs]

06:21.017 --> 06:23.017
... subjected to cold
and fatigue in their haste...

06:23.097 --> 06:25.347
[continues laughing]

06:28.687 --> 06:30.317
[inhales, grunts]

06:30.397 --> 06:33.317
[horses snorting, neighing]

06:34.317 --> 06:35.947
[SITARA (ADULT)]
...found themselves powerless

06:36.027 --> 06:37.817
against the Mongol offensive.

06:38.527 --> 06:39.577
[Tolui grunts]

06:41.037 --> 06:42.787
Fire!

06:46.367 --> 06:48.207
[men grunting]

06:51.757 --> 06:53.587
[SITARA (ADULT)]
And were annihilated.

06:53.667 --> 06:54.877
♪

06:55.377 --> 06:56.717
[men grunting]

07:02.177 --> 07:05.727
We must return...
back to the capital.

07:05.807 --> 07:07.477
[grunting]

07:09.307 --> 07:10.517
♪

07:14.527 --> 07:16.237
Made it just in time.

07:16.317 --> 07:17.447
[Wanyan gasps]

07:24.287 --> 07:25.617
Dear Brother!

07:25.697 --> 07:26.957
Tolui.

07:27.787 --> 07:30.707
-You really did it, didn't you?
-I did nothing.

07:34.047 --> 07:36.217
It was Tengri
who favored your flag

07:36.297 --> 07:37.547
throughout our battle.

07:38.047 --> 07:39.137
[ÖGEDEI] Still...

07:39.637 --> 07:41.967
I'm so blessed that
you're my younger brother.

07:42.387 --> 07:43.427
[Tolui gasps softly]

07:43.757 --> 07:44.847
[chuckles]

07:47.887 --> 07:49.517
You all right, General?

07:50.767 --> 07:52.937
I'm just thinking
about the past.

07:53.017 --> 07:55.187
Back when Genghis Khan
was at war

07:55.277 --> 07:57.067
with the other
steppe tribe leaders,

07:57.147 --> 07:59.237
the enemy performed
the jadamishi rite.

08:01.657 --> 08:05.157
But the storm didn't break over
Genghis Khan and his troops.

08:05.247 --> 08:07.327
It fell upon the enemy's forces.

08:07.407 --> 08:08.657
♪

08:12.837 --> 08:15.417
Now, when I look
at Prince Tolui,

08:16.087 --> 08:18.377
-it's almost as if he...
-[COMMANDER] General...

08:18.467 --> 08:20.677
Maybe we ought
to leave it at that.

08:22.007 --> 08:24.137
[SUBUTAI] Hm. Forget it.

08:24.217 --> 08:25.467
♪

08:25.557 --> 08:27.597
[SITARA (ADULT)]
After winter had passed,

08:27.677 --> 08:30.017
and spring was at its end,

08:30.097 --> 08:34.187
Ögedei and Tolui set out on
their journey back to Mongolia.

08:34.267 --> 08:36.817
Entrusting the capture
of Kaifeng

08:36.897 --> 08:40.197
to their most trusted
veteran generals.

08:40.277 --> 08:43.067
And they were enough
to do the job.

08:45.657 --> 08:48.117
Only two years after this,

08:48.197 --> 08:52.127
the Jin dynasty
would come to an end.

08:52.207 --> 08:53.377
♪

08:59.167 --> 09:01.467
[TOLUI] At this rate,
we'll be back in no time!

09:01.547 --> 09:04.507
Seems the circle hunt strategy
was quite a success.

09:04.597 --> 09:06.217
That right, Boroldai?

09:06.307 --> 09:08.427
Name's still Otai, Father.

09:08.517 --> 09:09.477
[TEMÜGE] Hmm.

09:10.477 --> 09:12.637
And while I didn't lose out
in the end,

09:12.727 --> 09:14.937
I didn't exactly gain much,
either.

09:15.017 --> 09:16.187
- [laughs]
- [TEMÜGE] I wonder

09:16.267 --> 09:18.937
who benefitted the most from it.

09:22.397 --> 09:23.947
♪

09:25.697 --> 09:26.697
[KIRGISTANI] Huh?

09:33.537 --> 09:36.207
Congratulations
on your great victory.

09:36.787 --> 09:37.837
[Ögedei grunts]

09:38.167 --> 09:40.127
Glad to see you're looking
so well, Boraqchin.

09:40.217 --> 09:42.087
I have acquired a gift for you.

09:42.167 --> 09:43.637
It should be arriving soon.

09:43.717 --> 09:45.387
-I think you'll be pleased.
-Huh?

09:45.467 --> 09:46.427
[BORAQCHIN] Mmm.

09:46.967 --> 09:49.347
We've made banquet preparations.
Please come this way.

09:49.427 --> 09:52.017
[exclaims] Say, Great Kha'an.

09:52.097 --> 09:54.687
What's this gift?
Is there one for me?

09:54.767 --> 09:58.227
-[laughs] Why, of course.
-Oh! What could it be?

09:58.317 --> 09:59.437
[Töregene exhales]

10:03.277 --> 10:04.237
[SITARA] Huh?

10:04.857 --> 10:06.027
[Shira chuckles]

10:06.117 --> 10:07.527
Shira!

10:11.957 --> 10:13.247
Hey, it's been a while.

10:13.327 --> 10:14.787
What are you doing here?

10:14.867 --> 10:16.837
I'm going to be serving
Prince Tolui for a bit.

10:16.917 --> 10:18.587
Princess's orders.

10:19.207 --> 10:20.417
♪

10:20.507 --> 10:22.467
[indistinct chatter, laughter]

10:30.137 --> 10:32.887
So, brother, which land
shall we invade next?

10:34.267 --> 10:36.597
I'd prefer to build
a capital first.

10:38.557 --> 10:41.397
-Fatima.
-Yes, my Lady Töregene?

10:41.477 --> 10:43.567
You can take your leave
for the evening.

10:44.067 --> 10:46.987
And when I'm in my tent,
don't disturb me.

10:47.067 --> 10:48.027
[SITARA] Uh?

10:58.167 --> 10:59.497
[SITARA] Lady Töregene...

10:59.587 --> 11:02.417
doesn't really say much to me
at all anymore.

11:03.507 --> 11:05.917
It almost seems like
she's avoiding me.

11:08.427 --> 11:10.637
Now I'm not to disturb her
in her tent.

11:10.717 --> 11:11.597
[gasps]

11:11.677 --> 11:12.757
♪

11:13.427 --> 11:14.727
[Sitara gasps]

11:14.807 --> 11:16.477
The Great Kha'an?

11:20.147 --> 11:22.147
[SITARA (ADULT)]
Just as Ögedei and Tolui

11:22.227 --> 11:24.937
were returning back
to their own territories,

11:25.027 --> 11:26.777
partway through...

11:26.857 --> 11:28.157
[Ögedei breathes heavily]

11:28.697 --> 11:29.947
Great Kha'an? [gasps]

11:30.577 --> 11:33.487
Great Kha'an! Rein in, men!

11:33.577 --> 11:34.947
Are you in pain? What is it?

11:35.037 --> 11:38.537
Great Kha'an?
Someone fetch a physician!

11:38.627 --> 11:39.787
[SITARA (ADULT)]
... Emperor Ögedei

11:39.877 --> 11:42.377
was suddenly struck down
by a mysterious illness.

11:47.927 --> 11:50.297
[Kirgistani crying]

11:50.387 --> 11:51.717
Great Kha'an!

11:51.797 --> 11:54.387
I'm certain he's just tired
from the long journey.

11:54.467 --> 11:55.977
-It will be all right, I'm sure.
-Oh, that poor man!

11:56.057 --> 11:57.977
[Kirgistani continues crying]

11:58.057 --> 12:00.937
[SITARA] What is it?
This ominous feeling.

12:01.017 --> 12:02.727
Something doesn't feel right.

12:02.807 --> 12:04.517
[MÖGE] Slave girl.

12:05.437 --> 12:06.527
Come with me.

12:08.397 --> 12:10.737
It seems the Great Kha'an
was poisoned.

12:10.817 --> 12:12.237
Poisoned?

12:12.327 --> 12:14.527
And it's not just
my false belief this time.

12:14.617 --> 12:17.077
-Boraqchin said so herself.
-[breathes shakily]

12:17.157 --> 12:19.037
Listen to me, you are the one

12:19.117 --> 12:21.577
who saved
Mistress Boraqchin's life.

12:21.667 --> 12:24.337
Which is why
I don't want to doubt you.

12:24.417 --> 12:26.087
What do you mean by that?

12:27.417 --> 12:31.257
The Great Kha'an's symptoms
are the same as Boraqchin's.

12:31.337 --> 12:33.347
He was poisoned
with Rahj al-gar.

12:33.427 --> 12:35.137
-[Sitara gasps]
-What's more...

12:35.217 --> 12:37.227
The Rahj al-gar
in Boraqchin's possession

12:37.307 --> 12:38.727
has suddenly disappeared.

12:39.057 --> 12:42.897
Only a few souls knew about it,
and where it was located.

12:42.977 --> 12:44.437
Lady Möge, I swear

12:44.517 --> 12:46.477
I don't know anything
about what happened!

12:46.567 --> 12:48.607
I would never aim to take
the Great Kha'an's life--

12:48.687 --> 12:51.027
What a great relief!
It really wasn't you!

12:51.107 --> 12:53.027
Huh? But I haven't made
my case yet.

12:53.117 --> 12:55.737
Nah, I wouldn't understand.
It's fine.

12:55.827 --> 12:57.117
But you know...

12:57.197 --> 12:58.957
Though I am not
the brightest person,

12:59.037 --> 13:02.077
I can tell pretty well whether
someone is lying to me or not.

13:02.537 --> 13:03.417
[SITARA] Uh?

13:03.997 --> 13:05.707
Are you lost again?

13:05.787 --> 13:06.837
[SITARA] Hm?

13:07.337 --> 13:08.717
[SITARA] Mm...

13:08.797 --> 13:10.797
[MÖGE] Hey! I can see
the doubt on your face!

13:11.587 --> 13:14.047
But still,
if it really wasn't you,

13:14.137 --> 13:16.347
then that would mean
it was Töregene.

13:16.427 --> 13:17.637
[Sitara gasps]

13:18.267 --> 13:19.847
[breathes uneasily]

13:20.177 --> 13:22.137
[both grunt]

13:22.227 --> 13:23.307
♪

13:43.997 --> 13:45.127
[breathes shakily]

13:45.207 --> 13:46.537
[MÖGE] Slave girl.

13:50.257 --> 13:53.047
Töregene turned out to have
the Rahj al-gar.

13:53.127 --> 13:54.427
[gasps]

13:54.507 --> 13:56.967
She's being held prisoner
while they investigate.

13:58.307 --> 13:59.387
[SITARA] Lady Töregene...

14:00.307 --> 14:03.847
It can't be. How?
Is this some sort of plot?

14:03.937 --> 14:07.767
Listen, slave girl,
I have a favor to ask of you.

14:08.857 --> 14:09.897
[Sitara gasps]

14:16.197 --> 14:17.237
[SITARA] Uh?

14:17.737 --> 14:19.947
Empress Boraqchin's ger?

14:20.037 --> 14:21.197
Go in.

14:22.867 --> 14:24.997
Pardon the intrusion. Uh?

14:25.917 --> 14:27.087
[BORAQCHIN] Fatima...

14:27.837 --> 14:29.667
Thank you both for coming.

14:30.337 --> 14:32.087
[Ögedei breathes shakily]

14:33.667 --> 14:36.717
I've requested your presence
for one reason.

14:36.797 --> 14:39.467
I would like for you
to save the Great Kha'an.

14:39.547 --> 14:41.347
[SITARA]
What do the physicians say?

14:41.427 --> 14:42.597
Who knows?

14:43.097 --> 14:45.637
Töregene may very well
have conspired with a physician.

14:45.727 --> 14:47.687
At the present time,
we can't be certain

14:47.767 --> 14:49.817
who is trustworthy or not.

14:51.147 --> 14:53.237
I beg of you. Help him.

15:02.657 --> 15:03.867
[SITARA] His symptoms...

15:03.957 --> 15:05.617
They're the same as yours,

15:05.707 --> 15:07.787
when you were poisoned
by Rahj al-gar.

15:07.877 --> 15:10.497
It's safe to assume that
he has been poisoned as well.

15:12.707 --> 15:15.167
I've already used
more than half of the stone.

15:16.417 --> 15:17.427
If you'll allow,

15:17.887 --> 15:20.257
I'll serve you as your
new Jada stone, Highness.

15:20.887 --> 15:24.517
Empress Boraqchin,
may I ask you one thing?

15:24.597 --> 15:27.017
-What is it?
-Lady Töregene...

15:27.097 --> 15:29.227
Why would she want
to poison him?

15:29.307 --> 15:32.897
I see. Töregene was
your mistress, wasn't she?

15:32.977 --> 15:35.527
I imagine this comes
as a great shock to you.

15:35.607 --> 15:36.777
-However...
-[gasps]

15:36.857 --> 15:39.027
That woman is a complete fool!

15:39.817 --> 15:41.697
She has openly shown resentment

15:41.777 --> 15:44.407
toward the Great Kha'an
time and time again.

15:44.907 --> 15:46.367
And upon gaining your wisdom,

15:46.457 --> 15:48.997
she was driven
to commit this foul act.

15:49.827 --> 15:53.337
I'm sure it was her intention
to lay all the blame onto you,

15:53.417 --> 15:55.457
and evade justice herself.

15:55.547 --> 15:57.047
That can't be true!

15:58.297 --> 15:59.467
I don't believe it.

15:59.547 --> 16:01.507
How can you be so sure?

16:01.597 --> 16:04.677
Because... she wouldn't do that.

16:04.757 --> 16:07.517
After all, she was willing
to tell me about everything.

16:08.387 --> 16:09.807
Everything...

16:09.897 --> 16:12.307
that she'd kept sealed away
in her heart.

16:12.897 --> 16:15.397
Even of the people
she'd once loved.

16:15.487 --> 16:17.897
And the anger
she bears to this day.

16:17.987 --> 16:19.647
Is that really so?

16:19.737 --> 16:21.777
[gasps] Huh?

16:21.867 --> 16:26.327
Fatima, you served Sorghaghtani
before you came here, yes?

16:26.407 --> 16:28.457
Töregene is hardly so naive

16:28.537 --> 16:30.457
that she would trust you
as easily as that,

16:30.537 --> 16:32.497
knowing who you
previously served?

16:32.587 --> 16:34.337
Now think back carefully, girl.

16:34.417 --> 16:35.957
Is there anything
she could have done

16:36.047 --> 16:38.047
that you might have found
remotely suspicious?

16:41.797 --> 16:45.007
[SITARA] Did Lady Töregene
really do this?

16:47.227 --> 16:48.597
Empress Boraqchin...

16:49.847 --> 16:51.137
Please grind up this stone

16:51.227 --> 16:54.227
and have the Great Kha'an
take some every day.

16:54.307 --> 16:57.937
If you end up running out,
please find another Jada stone.

16:58.027 --> 17:00.487
One with a similar color
to this stone if possible.

17:00.567 --> 17:01.607
[both gasp]

17:02.367 --> 17:04.487
-You have my gratitude.
-[chuckles]

17:11.917 --> 17:13.577
[grunts] Brother has fallen ill?

17:13.667 --> 17:16.247
So how is he faring?
Is it curable?

17:16.337 --> 17:18.667
[SHIRA] It is unknown
what disease has befallen him.

17:18.757 --> 17:20.417
But physicians
from east and west

17:20.507 --> 17:21.757
have convened to tend to him.

17:21.837 --> 17:24.547
I hear he is already
showing signs of recovery.

17:24.637 --> 17:25.807
Really?

17:25.887 --> 17:28.267
Great Khatun Boraqchin
has called for kams

17:28.347 --> 17:29.597
to perform an exorcism.

17:29.677 --> 17:31.887
And asks that you attend
as well, Highness.

17:31.977 --> 17:34.897
-[TOLUI] I'll go at once!
-[gasps] Wait, Tolui!

17:34.977 --> 17:35.977
[TOLUI] Uh?

17:37.147 --> 17:38.527
Sorghaghtani?

17:38.607 --> 17:41.857
He suddenly fell ill?
Something doesn't seem right.

17:43.107 --> 17:44.987
Shira, what did Fatima say?

17:45.487 --> 17:46.527
She told me...

17:47.407 --> 17:49.077
There are many
who won't take kindly

17:49.157 --> 17:51.447
to relying solely
on foreign physicians.

17:51.537 --> 17:54.457
Which is why they're adhering
to Mongol tradition

17:54.537 --> 17:56.127
by performing an exorcism.

17:56.207 --> 17:58.337
At least, that's what
I have been told.

17:58.417 --> 18:00.007
Well, that makes sense.

18:00.087 --> 18:01.797
Tell Princess Sorghaghtani this.

18:01.877 --> 18:02.797
[SHIRA] Huh?

18:03.587 --> 18:05.467
Please do not fret.

18:05.547 --> 18:07.557
Empress Boraqchin
is quite clever,

18:07.637 --> 18:10.717
and she is worthy
of being trusted. [chuckles]

18:12.517 --> 18:13.847
[SORGHAGHTANI] It's true.

18:13.937 --> 18:16.897
I've heard tell of how clever
Boraqchin Khatun is.

18:16.977 --> 18:19.777
You worry too much,
Sorghaghtani.

18:20.357 --> 18:23.487
'Cause after all,
it is merely an exorcism.

18:23.567 --> 18:25.817
Tengri has always sided
with my brother

18:25.907 --> 18:27.657
in his past battles.

18:27.737 --> 18:31.197
I'm quite sure...
Tengri will protect him now too.

18:31.747 --> 18:32.947
Yes.

18:36.167 --> 18:37.077
[Tolui grunts]

18:37.167 --> 18:38.207
Oh.

18:41.497 --> 18:43.877
[SORGHAGHTANI]
"It is merely an exorcism."

18:43.967 --> 18:45.627
I suppose that's true.

18:45.717 --> 18:47.927
I'll have to put my faith
in Fatima's words.

18:48.007 --> 18:49.807
[indistinct chatter]

18:57.357 --> 18:59.017
[MAN 1]
The Great Kha'an has fallen ill?

18:59.107 --> 19:01.817
I've heard rumors
someone put a curse on him.

19:01.897 --> 19:04.897
Hush! You mustn't speak
so frivolously about curses.

19:04.987 --> 19:07.157
-[chatter continues]
-[SITARA] Lady Töregene...

19:07.987 --> 19:10.577
I wish I could talk to you
right now.

19:11.197 --> 19:15.617
Perhaps this is my best chance,
amidst all this commotion.

19:15.707 --> 19:17.997
[chatter continues indistinctly]

19:31.927 --> 19:34.307
[Ögedei breathes heavily]

19:58.157 --> 19:59.577
The malevolent spirits

19:59.667 --> 20:02.587
have now been sealed away
in the water within this bowl.

20:02.667 --> 20:04.667
The guardian spirits
have spoken,

20:04.747 --> 20:06.377
and they tell us
that saving the patient

20:06.457 --> 20:08.797
will require a sacrifice
in his stead.

20:08.877 --> 20:11.967
One of you must drink
every last drop of this water.

20:12.047 --> 20:13.677
[all gasp]

20:16.887 --> 20:18.687
Then allow me to do it.

20:18.767 --> 20:20.147
[Möge gasps]

20:20.227 --> 20:22.647
[BORAQCHIN]
I'm past my prime already.

20:24.227 --> 20:26.227
[KAM] Please wait a moment.

20:27.107 --> 20:30.527
A blood relative would make
for a better sacrifice.

20:30.907 --> 20:32.197
What now?

20:32.277 --> 20:34.787
A child or grandchild
of the Great Kha'an

20:34.867 --> 20:37.657
would certainly suffice.
Or perhaps...

20:37.747 --> 20:39.077
A brother of his?

20:39.157 --> 20:40.577
[all gasp]

20:44.957 --> 20:46.837
Well then, it's me.

20:47.627 --> 20:49.007
Uncle.

20:49.087 --> 20:50.257
♪

21:08.227 --> 21:09.987
[TOLUI] Oh, Tengri...

21:10.817 --> 21:12.357
If it is for my brother's sins

21:12.447 --> 21:14.617
that you have made away
with his soul,

21:14.697 --> 21:18.497
then you already know of a soul
with deeper sins than his.

21:18.577 --> 21:21.077
For it is I who have taken
many more lives,

21:21.157 --> 21:23.247
and plundered more than he has.

21:28.047 --> 21:29.667
But wait, hold on.

21:29.757 --> 21:31.837
What if he was actually summoned
for his talents,

21:31.927 --> 21:34.427
to faithfully serve
at Tengri's side?

21:34.507 --> 21:37.137
Well, then.
I'm still the better choice.

21:37.217 --> 21:38.597
[all breathe uneasily]

21:40.057 --> 21:41.347
♪

21:46.977 --> 21:48.977
[Tolui gulping]

21:56.657 --> 21:57.867
[Tolui sighs]

21:57.947 --> 21:58.987
♪

22:09.747 --> 22:12.797
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:39.007 --> 23:41.597
[SITARA (ADULT)]
Next time: "Wisdom."
